{
    "result": {
        "response": "## Randomisation Details\n\n**Total Patients:** 90 patients with active UC will be enrolled competitively across approximately 25\u201330 investigational sites globally. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 29)\n\n**Randomisation Ratio:** Patients will be randomised equally (1:1:1) into **three arms**:\n- Placebo\n- TJ301 300 mg\n- TJ301 600 mg\n\nThis results in **30 patients per arm**. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 36)\n\n**Method:** Randomisation will be performed centrally and dynamically using a validated Interactive Web Response System (IWRS), stratified by:\n1. Prior corticosteroids treatment (yes/no)\n2. Consent to participate in PK substudy (yes/no)\n\n(Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 36)\n\n**PK Substudy (Mainland China only):** An additional subset of **24 patients** (8 per arm) in Mainland China will be centrally, dynamically randomised in a 1:1:1 fashion into the same three arms as part of a PK subgroup. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 37)",
