[A-6] What is the dosing schedule of the study drug?
-----------------------------------------------------------------
{
    "result": {
        "response": "## Dosing Schedule of TJ301\n\nThe dosing schedule for TJ301 in this study is as follows:\n\n### Treatment Period\n- **Frequency:** Infusions every **2 weeks (Q2W)** administered by trial personnel at the trial site (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 32)\n- **Duration:** **12 consecutive weeks** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 32)\n- **Total number of doses:** **6 doses** (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 32)\n- **Dosing type:** Fixed-dose throughout the trial (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 32)\n\n### Dose Levels\nThree dose levels are tested, all administered every other week (Q2W):\n1. **75 mg** every other week\n2. **300 mg** every other week\n3. **600 mg** every other week (maximum dose) (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 31)\n\n### Rationale for Maximum Dose and Duration\n- The maximum dose of 600 mg Q2W was selected based on Phase 1 safety data, where 600 mg weekly for 4 consecutive weeks was the maximum dose tested. The average plasma concentration is expected to be similar between the two studies. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 32)\n- A 12-week treatment period was chosen because biologics targeting UC (e.g., infliximab, golimumab) typically require at least 8 weeks to induce remission. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 32)",
        "sources": [
            {
                "name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf",
                "page": 32,
                "section": "3.4.5 Selection and Timing of Dose for Each Patient",
                "exactText": "During the 12-week Treatment Period, dosing will be infusions every 2 weeks, as administered by trial personnel at the trial site. Dosing is fixed-dose throughout the trial. In the multiple dosing parts of the phase I study of TJ301, the maximum dose of TJ301 was set as 600 mg weekly for 4 consecutive weeks (4 doses totally). In this study, TJ301 will be administered at up to 600 mg every two weeks for 12 consecutive weeks (6 doses totally).",
